<title>NETHERLANDS: Netanyahu resumes journey to Washington summit.</title>
<headline>Netanyahu resumes journey to Washington summit.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu continued his journey to Washington on Monday for an Israeli-PLO summit, after a brief refuelling stop in Amsterdam, an airport spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Netanyahu, speaking earlier to reporters aboard his Israeli air force plane, proposed non-stop talks with the Palestinians on Israeli troop redeployment in the West Bank city of Hebron.</p>
</text>
